# NOTE: as of the current bootstrap, you don't need a per-project .env on NERSC —
# MLflow credentials live in ~/.mlflow_credentials (mode 600, set up by bootstrap-nersc.sh)
# and the tracking URI is exported by ergodic-claude.sh. This file is kept only as a
# template in case you want per-project overrides for some env var.
#
# To use it: copy to .env in this dir, and add `source .env` to your launch command.

# export SOME_PROJECT_VAR=value
